# API rules

- The Backend developer owns this directory.
- Use FastAPI.
- Use Pydantic models for public API schemas.
- The backend owns future business logic.
- The backend will eventually own OpenAI communication.
- The backend will eventually communicate with n8n.
- Do not implement those integrations during initialization.
- Never hard-code secrets.
- Keep endpoint structure versioned under `/api/v1`.
- Preserve `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`.
- Do not modify web files.
- Prefer small services over complex abstractions.
- Avoid database infrastructure unless requested.
- Avoid background-worker infrastructure unless requested.
